        "text": "We have for $x \\geq 912560$,\n  \\[\n  \\sum_{p \\leq x} \\frac{\\log p}{p} = \\log x - B_3 + O^*\\Bigl(\\frac{0.3}{\\log^2 x}\\Bigr),\n  \\]\n  where $B_3 \\approx 1.33258$ is the constant from \\cite[Theorem 5.7]{Dusart2018}."
